rted as factual? It's absence, not observed. Not a factual finding from observation. Avoid.\n\nNeed preserve modality. Statement should be definitive from observed text.\n\nLet's craft:\n\n{\"findings\":[{\"statement\":\"The article in D10 is titled \\\"Examination of Prospective Teachers' Creative Comparisons for the Concept of 'Science Education'.\\\"\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"W12\"]},{\"statement\":\"The article in D10 is authored by Zeynel Abidin Yılmaz and Mehmet Diyaddin Yaşar.\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"W12\"]},{\"statement\":\"The D10 article was published in International Journal of Scholars in Education, 5(2), 101-116 (2022), with a publication date of 31.12.2022.\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"W12\"]}]}\n\nCheck: Is \"The article in D10\" okay? Observation doc_ref D10. The window_ref W12. The text has citation and title. Yes.\n\nPotential issue: \"authored by\" vs \"authors\" - Citation lists Yılmaz, Z. A., & Yaşar, M. D. Authors line: Zeynel Abidin YILMAZ, Mehmet Diyaddin YAŞAR. So good.\n\nShould we mention \"International Journal of Scholars in Education\" maybe okay. It's from citation. Good.\n\nNeed ensure no extra text. Final JSON."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1696,"completion_tokens":1197,"total_tokens":2893,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1060},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":0,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":1696},"system_fingerprint":"aeb56401ca74e127821c4f9126dcb669"}